{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2022-10-12 07:00:00', 'title': 'SUNPOWER AND GENERAL MOTORS TO POWER HOMES OF THE FUTURE WITH ELECTRIC VEHICLES', 'text': "COLLABORATION ENABLES BI-DIRECTIONAL CHARGING STARTING WITH THE RETAIL LAUNCH OF THE 2024 CHEVROLET SILVERADO EV, HELPING HOMEOWNERS TAKE MORE CONTROL OF THEIR ENERGY NEEDS SUNPOWER NAMED GM'S EXCLUSIVE SOLAR PROVIDER AND A PREFERRED EV CHARGER INSTALLER RICHMOND, CALIF. , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, SUNPOWER CORP. (NASDAQ:SPWR), A LEADING RESIDENTIAL SOLAR TECHNOLOGY AND ENERGY SERVICES PROVIDER, AND GENERAL MOTORS (NYSE: GM) ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION TO\xa0DEVELOP A NEW HOME ENERGY SYSTEM THAT WILL ENABLE GM ELECTRIC VEHICLES TO PROVIDE BACKUP ENERGY TO A HOME WHEN PROPERLY EQUIPPED."}